  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Also <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> must be continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>;</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>;</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />Now for <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math><mn>0</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p>"
